*
* Diode Sim Model Produced by Altium Ltd
* Date:  21-Mar-2003
*
* Manufacturer: Philips
* Component Name: PLVA656A
*
* This macromodel models the effect of carrier recombination-generation
* and high-level injection on the diode.
*
*Note: This macromodel derived from data sheets and pspice models obtained from Philips Semiconductor.

.SUBCKT PLVA656A 10 30

*These components model forward-biased conditions
D1 10 20 DIDEAL
D2 10 20 DRECOMB
D3 20 30 DHIGH

*These components model reversed-biased conditions
D4 30 60 DPARASITIC
RZ 50 60 0.295
Vbrk 50 10 5.6

* Subcircuit models
* +  BV =  5.1893
* +  IBV =  2.12E-01
.MODEL DIDEAL D
+(
+  IS =  5.3574E-16
+  N =  1.0029
+  TT =  1.3215E-07
+  CJO =  1.1942E-10
+  VJ =  0.62169
+  M =  0.32565
+)

.MODEL DHIGH D
+(
+  IS =  13.56610489
+  N =  1.0029
+  RS =  0.29276
+)

.MODEL DRECOMB D
+(
+  IS =  2.59678E-07
+  N =  5.919766159
+)

.MODEL DPARASITIC D
+(
+	N = 0.001
+	RS = 0.001
+	CJO = 0.001P
+)

.ENDS PLVA656A








